{"id":"srvhxn06bnhe52tz3i48sj4zn","title":"AWS Quick 的智能原语分类","originalTitle":"Taxonomy of agentic primitives in AWS Quick","summary":"AWS Quick 在构建过程中引入了智能原语分类，将智能工作分解为四个基本问题：何时、何事、何人和如何。这些原语通过触发器、代理和能力的关系定义了智能系统的框架，使得系统更易于理解和设计。该分类有助于区分用户请求中的不同执行类型，如人类发起、代理委派、定时任务和事件驱动任务。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"AWS Machine Learning Blog"},"links":{"original":"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/taxonomy-of-agentic-primitives-in-amazon-quick/"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-06T17:34:45.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-07T12:10:42.067Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-07T12:10:42.067Z","category":"paper","tags":["论文/研究","Agent"],"score":41,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"d038394f-0b58-417d-8ab8-519a4f24ac74","title":"Amazon Quick发布智能体原语分类框架，明确四大执行类型"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"Thomas Delteil","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"d038394f-0b58-417d-8ab8-519a4f24ac74","title":"Amazon Quick发布智能体原语分类框架，明确四大执行类型"}],"topics":[{"slug":"agent","name":"Agent 智能体"},{"slug":"papers","name":"论文研究"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fygRgGJPc31M","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}